{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites","id":1325763,"title":"Let's Build Power Suites","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-07-18T16:18:27-07:00","id":1325763,"title":"Let's Build Power Suites","content":"The purpose of this thread is three-fold. One, to help me figure out how the hell it actually works to construct one. Two, to let people exercise their creativity. Three, to help provide ideas and assistance to new players and Storyguides.<br /> <br /> Here is my first attempt, which I am sure is wrong.<br /> <br /> Wonderbolt is a young Nova who can command the winds and rain and storm. He can in particular fly on the winds, conjure weather effects, and shoot lightning bolts.<br /> <br /> Wonderbolt's Weather Power<br /> <br /> Elemental Mastery (Weather) 3 - 36xp, <br /> Base: Enviromental Anima 3, +Variable (12 XP)<br /> Technique - 12xp<br /> Quantum Attack 3 (Lightning Bolt) (Range 3) + Technique, Electrical (24XP)<br /> Technique - 12xp<br /> Flight 3 + Technique (12XP)<br /> <br /> Total Cost (Excluding the 32 for Q3) = 108","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T16:28:14-07:00","id":1325765,"title":"","content":"I think (not sure really) that\u2019s not how techniques work.<br /> <br /> That\u2019s the way I understand it works (I may be wrong and you right)<br /> <br /> Power Suit (Fire Mastery) have 3 dots and 3 tags + 3 technique tags<br /> Base Power (Environmental Anima, Heat) 2 dots, Range, Variable and Continuous tag<br /> Technique 1 (Quantum attack) 2 dots (grant 2 free tags, incendiary), deadly, disintegrating, bean<br /> Technique 2 (Quantum aura) 2 dots incendiary, deadly<br /> Technique 3 (Flight) 2 dots and 3 non used tags<br /> <br /> Total: Power 108 XP + Quantum 3 (minimum) 24 XP = 132 (18 left)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 07-18-2019, 10:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T17:08:07-07:00","id":1325777,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24985_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24985\" data-vbnamecard=\"24985\">Mateus Luz</a> Where are the 3 tags on Fire Mastery from, did you pay for those? Just trying to track","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T17:16:18-07:00","id":1325781,"title":"","content":"Hey <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24985_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24985\" data-vbnamecard=\"24985\">Mateus Luz</a> I think you might be missing 12 XP. My math has it go 2 dots (24 XP) + 3 tags (36 XP) + 4 Techniques (48 XP) = 108 + plus one Quantum (16) = 124, equals 24 XP left. <br /> <br /> From what I understand every Technique is given the exact same number of usable Power Dots and Tag Slots as the base effect, which forms the core of the power mastery itself. Usable though doesn't mean required, and so a player can go under said amount if they wish for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T17:18:52-07:00","id":1325783,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325781#post1325781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24985_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24985\" data-vbnamecard=\"24985\">Mateus Luz</a> I think you might be missing 12 XP. My math has it go 2 dots (24 XP) + 3 tags (36 XP) + 4 Techniques (48 XP) = 108 + plus one Quantum (16) = 124, equals 24 XP left.<br /> <br /> From what I understand every Technique is given the exact same number of usable Power Dots and Tag Slots as the base effect, which forms the core of the power mastery itself. Usable though doesn't mean required, and so a player can go under said amount if they wish for.</div> </div> </div> </div>Would that then eliminate any &quot;free&quot; tags gained by certain powers, such as Quantum Attack and Quantum Anima?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T17:26:03-07:00","id":1325787,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tragedyjones</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325783#post1325783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Would that then eliminate any &quot;free&quot; tags gained by certain powers, such as Quantum Attack and Quantum Anima?</div> </div> </div> </div>In my opinion no, because they come from Power Dot and that is something you paid for as part of the power theme. So, for example, a Technique based on Quantum Attack would get its free tags. (So in the above case since Quantum Attack 2 gives two free tags that technique has 2 +3. (Which is what he used in his example as well.) <br /> <br /> I do have to state, for the record, this is my assumption and that upon further developer commentary I might be wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T17:30:21-07:00","id":1325791,"title":"","content":"You buy 3 tags for the suit and all the techniques and the base power gains 3 tags for free. The only tags that can\u2019t be used like this are the technique tags (not tags from techniques, but the tags named technique).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T17:31:06-07:00","id":1325792,"title":"","content":"Take 2, Gravity Power!<br /> <br /> Gravitokinesis - 140XP Total<br /> <br /> This creates a Q3 nova, who can fly on debris, allow others to do the same, create Might 4 gravity fields, and have Durability 4 Forcefield that is barely noticeable and able to be shared.<br /> Quantum 3 - 32 XP<br /> Elemental Mastery (Gravity) - 3 dots for 36 XP, 3 Tags (36 XP), 3 Techniques (36 XP)<br /> <br /> Base Power: Environmental Anima<br /> Tags: Scale 3 (Free), Smashing, Duration, Grab<br /> <br /> Technique 1: Flight<br /> Tags: Bestow, Surfing, Reduced Cost<br /> <br /> Technique 2: Quantum Attack (Gravity Blast)<br /> Tags: Range 3 (Free), Piercing 1, Subtle 2<br /> <br /> Technique 3: Quantum Field<br /> Tags: Innocuous, 1 Bestow","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":3331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","user":"tragedyjones","date":". 07-18-2019, 08:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T17:32:27-07:00","id":1325793,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325781#post1325781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> I think you might be missing 12 XP. My math has it go 2 dots (24 XP) + 3 tags (36 XP) + 4 Techniques (48 XP) = 108 + plus one Quantum (16) = 124, equals 24 XP left. <br /> <br /> From what I understand every Technique is given the exact same number of usable Power Dots and Tag Slots as the base effect, which forms the core of the power mastery itself. Usable though doesn't mean required, and so a player can go under said amount if they wish for.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now corrected! Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T17:34:45-07:00","id":1325794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tragedyjones</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325792#post1325792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Take 2, Gravity Power!<br /> <br /> Gravitokinesis - 140XP Total<br /> <br /> This creates a Q3 nova, who can fly on debris, allow others to do the same, create Might 4 gravity fields, and have Durability 4 Forcefield that is barely noticeable and able to be shared.<br /> Quantum 3 - 32 XP<br /> Elemental Mastery (Gravity) - 3 dots for 36 XP, 3 Tags (36 XP), 3 Techniques (36 XP)<br /> <br /> Base Power: Environmental Anima<br /> Tags: Scale 3 (Free), Smashing, Duration, Grab<br /> <br /> Technique 1: Flight<br /> Tags: Bestow, Surfing, Reduced Cost<br /> <br /> Technique 2: Quantum Attack (Gravity Blast)<br /> Tags: Range 3 (Free), Piercing 1, Subtle 2<br /> <br /> Technique 3: Innocuous, 1 Bestow</div> </div> </div> </div>The third technique have no power. But you got it!<br /> Just be careful because not all power can reach the same dots according to your quantum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T17:40:30-07:00","id":1325797,"title":"","content":"The really cool thing about this is nothing stops you from having additional examples of the same Quantum Powers within a single Power Theme. What I mean by this is that you could spend 36 XP to buy three additional Quantum Attack techniques for your Fire Mastery power. One could be melee, one ranged, one area, etc. Same with say two flight, one for short distance and one for quick zooms around the world. Etc. <br /> <br /> Soooooooooooo many possibilities. <br /> <br /> ----<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tragedyjones</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325792#post1325792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Take 2, Gravity Power!<br /> <br /> Gravitokinesis - 140XP Total<br /> <br /> This creates a Q3 nova, who can fly on debris, allow others to do the same, create Might 4 gravity fields, and have Durability 4 Forcefield that is barely noticeable and able to be shared.<br /> Quantum 3 - 32 XP<br /> Elemental Mastery (Gravity) - 3 dots for 36 XP, 3 Tags (36 XP), 3 Techniques (36 XP)<br /> <br /> Base Power: Environmental Anima<br /> Tags: Scale 3 (Free), Smashing, Duration, Grab<br /> <br /> Technique 1: Flight<br /> Tags: Bestow, Surfing, Reduced Cost<br /> <br /> Technique 2: Quantum Attack (Gravity Blast)<br /> Tags: Range 3 (Free), Piercing 1, Subtle 2<br /> <br /> Technique 3: Innocuous, 1 Bestow</div> </div> </div> </div>While I am not sure what Technique 3 is, hehe, the general thing is yeah, I think this works. <br /> <br /> As a note the whole Range 3 only works cause your Quantum 3, which is an interesting prerequisite. <br /> <br /> Its a pretty nifty power by the way, looks like it would be quite fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T17:44:26-07:00","id":1325798,"title":"","content":"Corrected it. The 3rd technique was Quantum Field","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T18:13:55-07:00","id":1325807,"title":"","content":"Here's my spacetime controller's Power Suite. I've actually played her in one session of our Aberrant-playtest-that-hopefully-lasts-a-good-long-time game. So far, so good.<br /> <br /> Elemental Mastery (spacetime) 3, Base power: Quantum Anima (free: Might Scale 3, Strike), Duration (1: Maintenance), Technique (3)<br /> [3 dots for 36 points + 4 tags for 48 points = 84 points]<br /> * Technique: Quantum Field 3 (free: Scale 3, Rating 2, Complete, Environmental 1, Soft 2), Technique<br /> * Technique: Remote Perception 3, Technique<br /> * Technique: Warp 1 (can't be more than Quantum - 2) (free: Clear), Technique<br /> <br /> I gave each of the Techniques the Technique tag because, to my reading, the rules require them to have that tag in order to be part of the Power Suite, as opposed to powers that can be swapped for Quantum Anima one at a time. I'm hoping that my interpretation is wrong. I'll be asking about it on the &quot;ask the folks who ought to know&quot; thread next.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12791-fortunatus","name":"Fortunatus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12791_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T18:27:52-07:00","id":1325810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fortunatus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325807#post1325807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here's my spacetime controller's Power Suite. I've actually played her in one session of our Aberrant-playtest-that-hopefully-lasts-a-good-long-time game. So far, so good.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> I gave each of the Techniques the Technique tag because, to my reading, the rules require them to have that tag in order to be part of the Power Suite, as opposed to powers that can be swapped for Quantum Anima one at a time. I'm hoping that my interpretation is wrong. I'll be asking about it on the &quot;ask the folks who ought to know&quot; thread next.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hears to hoping that you get to play said game for a good long time! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Its a cool set of powers, very nifty, and quite well thought out in what it allows your character to do. <br /> <br /> ------<br /> <br /> On the whole technique thing my thought is that its sort of in a state of unlisted but there. That by buying a technique the power that you bought has it as a slot, but its a slot you can't use as its locked behind the ability to be usable. <br /> <br /> So when say &quot;Technique 2 (Quantum aura) 2 dots incendiary, deadly&quot; What we are also saying is &quot;Technique 2 (Quantum aura) 2 dots incendiary, deadly, technique&quot; <br /> <br /> But we aren't writing it out because its there. Cause otherwise you aren't spending 12 XP you have to spend 24, 12 for the technique tag and then another 12 for a tag slot that can be used as technique, and that seems a little wasteful. <br /> <br /> But all that said this is just my opinion and I could be wrong, though I hope I'm not in the sense of having to spend even more points then we thought was needed. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T18:59:17-07:00","id":1325815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325810#post1325810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the whole technique thing my thought is that its sort of in a state of unlisted but there. That by buying a technique the power that you bought has it as a slot, but its a slot you can't use as its locked behind the ability to be usable.<br /> <br /> So when say &quot;Technique 2 (Quantum aura) 2 dots incendiary, deadly&quot; What we are also saying is &quot;Technique 2 (Quantum aura) 2 dots incendiary, deadly, technique&quot;<br /> <br /> But we aren't writing it out because its there. Cause otherwise you aren't spending 12 XP you have to spend 24, 12 for the technique tag and then another 12 for a tag slot that can be used as technique, and that seems a little wasteful.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think of it this way. I'm paying 12 points (definitely not 24) to have another power in a Power Suite. Part of the cost of the privilege of paying only 12 points for a totally new power, complete with dots and built-in tags and maybe even extra tags, is that the power has one less tag than it could have if it were the base power. The &quot;lost&quot; tag is reserved for the Technique tag, which says &quot;I'm part of that power up there&quot;. As far as I'm concerned, that's a really good deal.<br /> (Note that the base power does <i>not</i> have to include an extra Technique tag.)<br /> <br /> The reason I think that's so is because of the last sentence of the Technique tag's description. &quot;The Technique cannot have more dots or power tags than the original power and <b>must include the Technique tag</b> to be part of a Power Suite (p. XX) for that power.&quot; (emphasis mine)<br /> <br /> The question that arises, then, is what the heck happens if I make a Power Suite with a base power that has no other tags than Technique? Does each of its Techniques then have to drop one of their &quot;free&quot; tags? What if one of those Techniques is Flight, which doesn't include &quot;free&quot; tags? Does the Flight then operate at one less dot?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325810#post1325810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But all that said this is just my opinion and I could be wrong, though I hope I'm not in the sense of having to spend even more points then we thought was needed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, this is all just our various opinions until a dev speaks. And then it becomes house rules. ;p","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12791-fortunatus","user":"Fortunatus","date":". 07-18-2019, 10:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12791-fortunatus","name":"Fortunatus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12791_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T19:10:39-07:00","id":1325816,"title":"","content":"All the technique tags must be in all the powers of the suit, so if the main power has no tag, no power has any extra tag.<br /> <br /> The limit of power in a suit is the number of times you can get a tag (in this case the technique tag), that is equal to quantum. So your suit can\u2019t have more powers than you have quantum. For that I will correct my suit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 07-18-2019, 10:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T19:33:09-07:00","id":1325822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fortunatus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325815#post1325815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think of it this way. I'm paying 12 points (definitely not 24) to have another power in a Power Suite. Part of the cost of the privilege of paying only 12 points for a totally new power, complete with dots and built-in tags and maybe even extra tags, is that the power has one less tag than it could have if it were the base power. The &quot;lost&quot; tag is reserved for the Technique tag, which says &quot;I'm part of that power up there&quot;. As far as I'm concerned, that's a really good deal.<br /> (Note that the base power does <i>not</i> have to include an extra Technique tag.)<br /> <br /> The reason I think that's so is because of the last sentence of the Technique tag's description. &quot;The Technique cannot have more dots or power tags than the original power and <b>must include the Technique tag</b> to be part of a Power Suite (p. XX) for that power.&quot; (emphasis mine)<br /> <br /> The question that arises, then, is what the heck happens if I make a Power Suite with a base power that has no other tags than Technique? Does each of its Techniques then have to drop one of their &quot;free&quot; tags? What if one of those Techniques is Flight, which doesn't include &quot;free&quot; tags? Does the Flight then operate at one less dot?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, I see what you are saying. Hmm. Okay. I see, I see.<br /> <br /> Well no matter what the techniques will have the tag that is being used by the Technique tag in others. So I can't see this being lost.<br /> <br /> I also don't know if you can use the free tags given by some powers - like Quantum Attack - to represent the technique tag.<br /> <br /> I guess maybe the 12 XP to have a technique is not, in and of itself, a Technique Tag. Which I think is where some of my mental confusion came from. The core power, the Elemental Mastery really, doesn't have Technique in its tag list, it doesn't need it, it is not actually a technique.<br /> <br /> Its the lesser powers that come from it, the techniques, that need the Technique tag. Which means you can't build a power theme until you purchase at least one additional tag. Or, I guess, get it from a power that gives them automatically.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325816#post1325816\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All the technique tags must be in all the powers of the suit, so if the main power has no tag, no power has any extra tag.<br /> <br /> The limit of power in a suit is the number of times you can get a tag (in this case the technique tag), that is equal to quantum. So your suit can\u2019t have more powers than you have quantum. For that I will correct my suit.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't stack the techniques. that is it isn't Technique 4, it is Technique 1 four times. This is important because it literally says you cna have an infinite number of Tag 1s in a power even at Quantum 1.<br /> <br /> Which means I think you could purchase 5 techniques for even a Quantum 1 character.<br /> <br /> That said. I can see where others are coming from. The core ability (the original power) would have 1 additional usable tag then all other techniques in the power because for them the tag is being used as Technique.<br /> <br /> ----<br /> <br /> So basically all that the few Power Suites that were created here need to do to get upgraded is to spend 12 XP to create an additional Tag for the base effect. Or, if their base effect already had tags (say in the examples were we wrote up 2 or 3 tags) then remove one of the potential tags in the lower techniques and call it, well, Technique. Which actually might mean costs won't change though the subordinate techniques might loose some capability.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","user":"LordHeru","date":". 07-18-2019, 10:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T19:40:16-07:00","id":1325825,"title":"","content":"\u201cA nova cannot have more points in a single power tag than their Quantum rating. So, a nova with Quantum 4 is limited to no more than 4 points in any individual power tag, although the nova may have an unlimited number of 1-point power tags on a single power.\u201d<br /> <br /> What he means by single tag is the same tag, so technique is a tag, and you can\u2019t pick it more than quantum times. But you can pick several different tags, as many as you can pay for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T19:44:20-07:00","id":1325826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325825#post1325825\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u201cA nova cannot have more points in a single power tag than their Quantum rating. So, a nova with Quantum 4 is limited to no more than 4 points in any individual power tag, although the nova may have an unlimited number of 1-point power tags on a single power.\u201d<br /> <br /> What he means by single tag is the same tag, so technique is a tag, and you can\u2019t pick it more than quantum times. But you can pick several different tags, as many as you can pay for.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't really see how that says Quantum limits the number of techniques that can be in a Power Suite. Mostly because you are not stacking Techniques, rather each is going to a different subordinate power. <br /> <br /> I totally accept that a Power Tag must be available and used in each technique, I get that. But at the same time II don't think that this translates that having Quantum 2 means only two techniques can be in a power. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","user":"LordHeru","date":". 07-18-2019, 10:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T19:56:46-07:00","id":1325829,"title":"","content":"I am pretty sure of the opposite, but so far we are dealing with something we are not totally understanding, so... let\u2019s have some time with this and have fun with the rules we have (they are awesome).<br /> <br /> We can try to discover this tomorrow, now I go to sleep... had too much fun for a single day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T20:20:10-07:00","id":1325836,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325822#post1325822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn't stack the techniques. that is it isn't Technique 4, it is Technique 1 four times. This is important because it literally says you cna have an infinite number of Tag 1s in a power even at Quantum 1.<br /> <br /> Which means I think you could purchase 5 techniques for even a Quantum 1 character.</div> </div> </div> </div>I concur. It never occurred to me that the number of powers in a Power Suite would be limited by Quantum. Though, I suppose it should have, given my misinterpretation of the Technique tag. Now I get why it's Technique (1) and not Technique (X).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12791-fortunatus","name":"Fortunatus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12791_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T20:34:21-07:00","id":1325843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fortunatus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325836#post1325836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I concur. It never occurred to me that the number of powers in a Power Suite would be limited by Quantum. Though, I suppose it should have, given my misinterpretation of the Technique tag. Now I get why it's Technique (1) and not Technique (X).</div> </div> </div> </div>Right. Out of all the tags this one is quite easily confused. (Still its quite fun to be honest.) <br /> <br /> But yeah if it was Technique (X) then I could see it being &quot;for every dot purchased gain one technique&quot; which might cause a limit based on Quantum. (Which isn't entirely a bad way to write it out, though I still think a limit based on Quantum is a bit off.&quot; <br /> <br /> That said I am looking forward to clarification and such. Though I admit to really hoping there is no limit, beyond that of what one is willing to pay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T20:43:29-07:00","id":1325854,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325843#post1325843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But yeah if it was Technique (X) then I could see it being &quot;for every dot purchased gain one technique&quot; which might cause a limit based on Quantum. (Which isn't entirely a bad way to write it out, though I still think a limit based on Quantum is a bit off.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, I just sent a suggestion to rewrite it exactly that way. I wish I'd read your post before I did. I'm agreed in full about not wanting to limit the size of Power Suites to Quantum.<br /> <br /> Something like, &quot;for every instance of the Technique tag purchased, gain one Technique,&quot; would work just as well.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12791-fortunatus","name":"Fortunatus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12791_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T00:40:22-07:00","id":1325901,"title":"","content":"Using Tragedyjones\u2019s example;<br /> <br /> \u201cElemental Mastery (Gravity) - 3 dots for 36 XP, 3 Tags (36 XP), 3 Techniques (36 XP) \u201c<br /> <br /> That\u2019s 98 exp in expenditure right there for what looks like 3 dots of power and a mass of techniques to be defined later. Are the Tags each a separate item or are they modifying the base dot of the power like an Extra used to?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T03:16:16-07:00","id":1325923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fortunatus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325836#post1325836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now I get why it's Technique (1) and not Technique (X).</div> </div> </div> </div>About this: it\u2019s technique (1) and not technique (x), it would mean that it can be picked only once, not infinite times.<br /> <br /> For example, Hard Armor have only 2 costs, 1 or 3, 1 gives 1 extra health box and 3 gives 2 health boxes. You can\u2019t pick Hard 1 3 times and get 3 health boxes, otherwise there wold not be a Health 3 option.<br /> Same for Technique.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T06:39:25-07:00","id":1325965,"title":"","content":"I think Mateus is probably right on this. I expect that it's Technique (1), with no mention in its description of being able to be applied more than once (unlike, say, the Area power tag), to get around the problem of limiting the number of Techniques in a Power Suite by Quantum.<br /> <br /> So, then, how does Technique work?<br /> <br /> &quot;The Technique power tag (p. XX) enables a nova to use one Quantum Power to duplicate the effects of another, ....&quot; So, the Technique tag is placed on a power, and that power can optionally pretend to be a different power (or a different version of the same power). That's simple enough. The part that gets a little weird is that the Technique itself must also &quot;include the Technique tag to be part of a Power Suite (p. XX) for that power.&quot;<br /> <br /> So, it appears that Power Suites work as follows:<br /> (Assume this character has already bought Quantum 3)<br /> Elemental Mastery (kinetic force) Power Suite<br /> -base power: Quantum Anima 3, free tags[Scale, Manipulation, Strike], Technique (1) [48 points]<br /> --Technique of Quantum Anima: Quantum Attack 3, free tags[Range 2, Beam], Technique (1) [0 points, as this is just the power that Quantum Anima can emulate via the Technique tag]<br /> ---Technique of Quantum Attack: Quantum Field 3, free tags[Complete (3), Environmental (1), Soft Armor (2)], Technique (1) [0 points, as it's just what Quantum Attack can emulate]<br /> ----Technique of Quantum Field: Flight 3, Technique (1) [0 points]<br /> -----Technique of Flight: Environmental Anima 3, Technique (1) [0 points]<br /> <br /> And so on, for a total cost of 48 points regardless of how many Techniques are in the suite. That is an amazing deal, and I'm not sure that it's what was intended. My expectation is that the cost of my original interpretation is closer to the mark.<br /> <br /> Also, why does the last power in the suite have to take the Technique power tag? I don't know, and think it shouldn't. Otherwise, I'm owed an infinite number of Techniques! I expect that the wording of the Technique tag will be cleaned up to deal with that problem.<br /> <br /> Finally, what, exactly, does the restriction, &quot;The Technique cannot have more dots or power tags than the original power...,&quot; mean? Does that mean that the ranks in those power tags don't matter, allowing something like:<br /> Quantum Attack 3, free tags[Scale (1), Range (1), Beam (1)], <b>Subtle (1)</b>, Technique (1)<br /> -Technique of Quantum Attack: Quantum Attack 3, free tags[Scale (1), Range (1), Beam (1)], <b>Reduced Cost (4)</b>, Technique (1)<br /> <br /> Or, does it mean that the Technique can only have as many points of power tags as the original? I'm assuming that that's the actual intention, but I could be wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12791-fortunatus","name":"Fortunatus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12791_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T06:57:55-07:00","id":1325968,"title":"","content":"I am so glad I am not the only one confused. This is the sort of thing that could use an example sidebar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T07:38:45-07:00","id":1325977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tragedyjones</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325968#post1325968\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am so glad I am not the only one confused. This is the sort of thing that could use an example sidebar.</div> </div> </div> </div>My suggestion is to go to the Kickstarter and drop the suggestion into the prepared questionnaire.<br /> <br /> Now my take on power suite<br /> <br /> Space master.<br /> Elemental mastery Bending space<br /> 3dots of environmental anima as a base effect with complication chosen as default: non-terrestrial(0), Variable(1), Range(1) Technique(2) 36+12+12 +24= 84<br /> <br /> I do have four tags to work within my two techniques<br /> Squish: Quantum attack 3dots gives : Brutal(1), aggravated(2) and I buy ranged(1) for 12 12<br /> Tear it down: Quantum attack 3 dots free 3 points of tags Area(2), brutal(1), Ramp up(-2) Destructive(2) <br /> <br /> Cost of power 96 Environmental anima feels subpar as a choice for base power. You do not get free tags in it, so you must buy some.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6491-zorb42","name":"zorb42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T07:44:15-07:00","id":1325978,"title":"","content":"I took a long time to get it in M&amp;M 2e, only when I went thru the example characters that used it. Honestly the \u201cAlternate Power\u201d looked to me a cheat in the game, but it work fine once you learn to use it.<br /> <br /> I think the way we were dealing with Techniques before is the correct, and in fact you can pick it multiple times, up to Quantum. The idea is not complex if you think it as a Power Suit that define the number of Dot slots and tag slots, and the technique tag defines the number of techniques you can add.<br /> <br /> Think it like a table, you have one base line (base power) with dots and tags cells in that line, the technique tag don\u2019t add a tag cel to the line, add a new entire line to be used.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T07:47:40-07:00","id":1325979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325978#post1325978\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Think it like a table, you have one base line (base power) with dots and tags cells in that line, the technique tag don\u2019t add a tag cel to the line, add a new entire line to be used.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that's the way it <i>should</i> work, but that's not the way it's written.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12791-fortunatus","name":"Fortunatus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12791_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T07:49:26-07:00","id":1325980,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325978#post1325978\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I took a long time to get it in M&amp;M 2e, only when I went thru the example characters that used it. Honestly the \u201cAlternate Power\u201d looked to me a cheat in the game, but it work fine once you learn to use it.<br /> <br /> I think the way we were dealing with Techniques before is the correct, and in fact you can pick it multiple times, up to Quantum. The idea is not complex if you think it as a Power Suit that define the number of Dot slots and tag slots, and the technique tag defines the number of techniques you can add.<br /> <br /> Think it like a table, you have one base line (base power) with dots and tags cells in that line, the technique tag don\u2019t add a tag cel to the line, add a new entire line to be used.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with this. It makes sense to limit the number of techniques, without limiting it significantly and seems to feed into the theme you want high quantum nova on chargen, that seems to be going on.<br /> <br /> One limitation we seem to have not picked. If you use reflexive and normal(?) action coming from the same suite. You are always performing complex action.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6491-zorb42","name":"zorb42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T07:49:54-07:00","id":1325981,"title":"","content":"One comment about limiting techniques by quantum:<br /> <br /> If we have a limitation on the quantum, it would be the reason why Novas with high quantum seams to have more powers, or at least a larger variety of powers, while the low quantum novas are more straightforward.<br /> <br /> Imagine the bazillion XP for building the powers from Mal, but if they are in a huge power suit (quantum 7 means 8 different powers per suit), you reduce the cost by 8, getting \u215b of a bazillion... that\u2019s still a lot, BUT it\u2019s 8 times less...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T07:54:55-07:00","id":1325985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>zorb42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325980#post1325980\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One limitation we seem to have not picked. If you use reflexive and normal(?) action coming from the same suite. You are always performing complex action.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don\u2019t think so.<br /> <br /> \u201cMoreover, while a Power Suite may have multiple effects, using more than one of them at a time in a round counts as a mixed action (p. XX), even if that effect would normally be a reflexive action.\u201d<br /> <br /> Notice that it says \u201cusing more than one of them at a time\u201d so you need to share the successes between the techniques in use, I would say if you are using flight and quantum attack from the same suit, you need to spend one success to maintain flight active and the rest to fire your attack, but if you are in the ground you can use a technique as a normal power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T07:58:25-07:00","id":1325986,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1325763-let-s-build-power-suites?p=1325985#post1325985\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don\u2019t think so.<br /> <br /> \u201cMoreover, while a Power Suite may have multiple effects, using more than one of them at a time in a round counts as a mixed action (p. XX), even if that effect would normally be a reflexive action.\u201d<br /> <br /> Notice that it says \u201cusing more than one of them at a time\u201d so you need to share the successes between the techniques in use, I would say if you are using flight and quantum attack from the same suit, you need to spend one success to maintain flight active and the rest to fire your attack, but if you are in the ground you can use a technique as a normal power.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, yes, that is what I mean. Ehh I forgot to include at the same time.<br />","signature":"","edited":{